    "detailed_description": "This game is a 3D platformer that holds some puzzling moments and difficult jumps- make precise movements to parkour to the end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Atmosphere </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique graphics and atmosphere with shading resembling a colored pencil drawing<br></li><li> Large floating objects in the distance...</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Indirect storytelling</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple checkpoints, no need to stress<br></li><li> Gameplay is easily paused at any point to be resumed later<br></li><li> Replay value in speedrunning for the fastest time</li></ul>",
